1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,703
And because the incident wavefront, the mirror and the reflected wavefront are all built in the same plane, the incident ray, the reflected ray and the normal are coplanar.

2
00:00:10,703 --> 00:00:12,122
That is the first law.

3
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:14,531
Both laws, from one construction.

